+/*
+ * Initialize libzfs using an already-open /dev/zfs file descriptor.
+ *
+ * The descriptor is duplicated internally; the caller keeps ownership and
+ * must close it.  This allows a process to open /dev/zfs, restrict the
+ * descriptor with cap_rights_limit(2), enter capability mode with
+ * cap_enter(2), and only then initialize libzfs.
